OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners claim minister
OL,4,Aattempting to undermine 'Holiday Hunger
OL,5,ABill'
OL,6,
OL,7,FCampaigners have accused the education
OL,8,Fminister of attempting to undermine a
OL,9,Fproposed Stormont law which would help
OL,10,Fpoorer families with the cost of food.
OL,12,FThe Democratic Unionist Party's (DUP)
OL,13,FPaul Givan has been consistently
OL,14,Fcritical of the legislation which is
OL,15,Fbeing brought forward by Sinn Fein
OL,16,Fassembly member Danny Baker.
OL,18,FGivan has warned it would immediately
OL,19,Fcost his department #20m a year at a
OL,20,Ftime when it is already struggling to
OL,21,Fbalance its budget.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
