OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners claim minister
OL,4,Aattempting to undermine 'Holiday Hunger
OL,5,ABill'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Holiday Meals Payment Bill would
OL,8,Fcreate a new payment for families whose
OL,9,Fchildren receive free school meals
OL,10,Fwhich would be made during school
OL,11,Fholidays to help with the cost of food.
